#: ../../source/templates_airtable.md:6
msgid ""
"The original site uses proprietary fonts. For self-contained HTML output,"
" use these CDN substitutes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_airtable.md:7
msgid "**Primary:** `Inter` | **Mono:** `system monospace stack`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_airtable.md:8
msgid ""
"**Font stack (CSS):** `font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, "
"'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_airtable.md:9
msgid ""
"**Mono stack (CSS):** `font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, "
"Monaco, Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', 'Courier New', monospace;`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_airtable.md:13
msgid ""
"Use `write_file` to create HTML, serve via `generative-widgets` skill "
"(cloudflared tunnel). Verify visual accuracy with `browser_vision` after "
"generating."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_airtable.md:16
msgid "1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_airtable.md:18
msgid ""
"Airtable's website is a clean, enterprise-friendly platform that "
"communicates \"sophisticated simplicity\" through a white canvas with "
"deep navy text (`#181d26`) and Airtable Blue (`#1b61c9`) as the primary "
"interactive accent. The Haas font family (display + text variants) "
"creates a Swiss-precision typography system with positive letter-spacing "
"throughout."
msgstr ""

